[0,"Oh, I'm so glad!","O, kaip smagu!","a1ac29d89154",2.38],[0,"Take care, dear! Enjoy the rest of your day.","Laikykitės, mielasis! Gražios likusios dienos.","4ad19d484d55",3.32],[0,"Good morning! Can I help you with anything?","Labas rytas! Ar galiu kuo nors padėti?","e41bd7bdf4bc",2.85],[-1,"Excuse me, can you help me, please?","Atsiprašau, ar galite man padėti?",1],[0,"Sure! What happened?","Žinoma! Kas atsitiko?","3deec8c14021",2.13],[-1,"I've lost my backpack.","Pamečiau kuprinę.",1],[0,"Oh, dear! Don't panic.","Oi, vargeli! Tik nepanikuokite.","35eaf7ee5b64",2.94],[0,"When did you last have it?","Kada paskutinį kartą ją turėjote?","bea6ac33171a",2.16],[-1,"At the café.","Kavinėje.",1],[0,"Then go back to the café and ask.","Tada grįžkite į kavinę ir paklauskite.","042d6fb62809",2.72],[0,"Maybe someone found it.","Galbūt kas nors ją rado.","67474402458d",1.87],[0,"What does it look like, in case someone brings it here?","Kaip ji atrodo – jeigu kas nors atneštų čia?","30ca2b559c91",3.49],[-1,"It's brown, leather, and small.","Ji ruda, odinė ir maža.",1],[0,"Okay, a small brown leather backpack. I'll remember that.","Gerai, maža ruda odinė kuprinė. Įsiminsiu.","c695ae4075ef",4.85],[0,"And if it's not there, go to the police station.","O jei jos ten nėra, eikite į policijos nuovadą.","24b242457bef",3.22],[0,"Do you know where it is?","Ar žinote, kur ji?","fa3703cfa909",1.62],[-1,"No, I'm good, thanks.","Ne, man nereikia, ačiū.",1],[0,"It's just around the corner.","Ji visai netoli, už kampo.","fb8a5e2bb34e",2.06],[0,"Go straight down this street. It's on the left.","Eikite tiesiai šia gatve. Ji bus kairėje.","d1e0dfe27ee7",3.61],[0,"Good luck, dear!","Sėkmės, mielasis!","944947309560",1.37],[-1,"I think someone took my wallet.","Manau, kažkas paėmė mano piniginę.",1],[0,"Oh no! Are you sure? Maybe you just dropped it.","O ne! Ar tikrai? Galbūt tiesiog ją pametėte.","b167f745bd00",4.74],[0,"Where did you last have it?","Kur paskutinį kartą ją turėjote?","d90e15def1d7",1.96],[-1,"Near the bench.","Prie suoliuko.",1],[0,"Then go back to the bench and look.","Tada grįžkite prie suoliuko ir pažiūrėkite.","7d8b6effe731",2.68],[-1,"It's a small black wallet.","Tai maža juoda piniginė.",1],[0,"Okay, a small black wallet. Got it.","Gerai, maža juoda piniginė. Supratau.","a9c14cba16a4",4.24],[-1,"Could you repeat that, please?","Ar galėtumėte pakartoti?",1],[-1,"Thanks for your help!","Ačiū už pagalbą!",1],[0,"No problem!","Nėra už ką!","1fe04dc4140b",1.38],[-1,"Could you speak more slowly, please?","Ar galėtumėte kalbėti lėčiau?",1],[0,"Of course. I'll say it slowly.","Žinoma. Pasakysiu lėtai.","a324e0e54fc5",2.77],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[0,"Good.","Puiku.","a6da66ea1f3a",0.69],[0,"Good luck! I hope you find it.","Sėkmės! Tikiuosi, kad ją rasite.","a48448667f71",2.28],[0,"Hi! Are you okay? You look worried.","Sveiki! Ar Jums viskas gerai? Atrodote susirūpinęs.","b37ddecdb537",3.7],[-1,"I think someone took my bag.","Manau, kažkas paėmė mano rankinę.",1],[-1,"About an hour ago.","Maždaug prieš valandą.",1],[0,"And where were you then?","O kur tada buvote?","230dde0588e2",1.75],[-1,"At the bakery.","Kepykloje.",1],[0,"Then go back to the bakery and ask.","Tada grįžkite į kepyklą ir paklauskite.","e06a16f983eb",2.78],[0,"Okay, a small brown leather bag. Got it.","Gerai, maža ruda odinė rankinė. Supratau.","d90ab5e935f9",3.86],[-1,"Could you show me on the map?","Ar galėtumėte parodyti žemėlapyje?",1],[0,"Sure, look. Here it is, on my phone.","Žinoma, žiūrėkite. Štai ji, mano telefone.","12833991e14f",3.88],[0,"Here, I'll mark it on your map.","Štai, pažymėsiu ją Jūsų žemėlapyje.","52771f779f94",2.15],[0,"Of course, dear. What's wrong?","Žinoma, mielasis. Kas nutiko?","6d7e0167a6f8",2.21],[-1,"I can't find my wallet.","Nerandu savo piniginės.",1],[0,"Oh no! Don't worry, we'll figure it out.","O ne! Nesijaudinkite, ką nors sugalvosime.","2871ec2d3e5f",3.56],[-1,"At the museum.","Muziejuje.",1],[0,"Then go back to the museum and ask.","Tada grįžkite į muziejų ir paklauskite.","b0ababa1b33b",2.13],[0,"Okay, a small brown leather wallet. Got it.","Gerai, maža ruda odinė piniginė. Supratau.","795cd670bcc2",3.81],[-1,"Is it far?","Ar toli?",1],[0,"No, it's very close. Just two minutes on foot.","Ne, labai arti. Tik dvi minutės pėsčiomis.","db5cc9432e9d",3.62],[-1,"I've lost my phone.","Pamečiau telefoną.",1],[0,"Okay, let's think. When did you last see it?","Gerai, pagalvokime. Kada paskutinį kartą jį matėte?","8e3851795fd3",4.59],[0,"Maybe someone found it.","Galbūt kas nors jį rado.","67474402458d",1.87],[0,"What does it look like? I'll keep an eye out.","Kaip jis atrodo? Aš pasidairysiu.","c52b9139a43a",2.55],[0,"Okay, a small brown leather phone. Got it.","Gerai, mažas rudas odinis telefonas. Supratau.","5945225b290b",4.22],[0,"And if it's not there, go to the police station.","O jei jo ten nėra, eikite į policijos nuovadą.","24b242457bef",3.22],[-1,"That would be great, thanks.","Būtų puiku, ačiū.",1],[-1,"At the park.","Parke.",1],[0,"Then go back to the park and look around.","Tada grįžkite į parką ir apsidairykite.","0e99726afcfe",3],[0,"Okay, a small brown leather wallet. I'll remember that.","Gerai, maža ruda odinė piniginė. Įsiminsiu.","3bfff0e57b8e",5.09],[-1,"Sure, thanks!","Žinoma, ačiū!",1],[-1,"It's small and brown.","Ji maža ir ruda.",1],[0,"Okay, a small brown bag. I'll remember that.","Gerai, maža ruda rankinė. Įsiminsiu.","0630f7b7c8ee",4.2],[0,"Oh, wait! This little boy found a small brown bag by the fountain!","O, palaukite! Šis berniukas rado mažą rudą rankinę prie fontano!","0bb7e57ffa96",5.36],[-1,"No, that's not mine.","Ne, tai ne mano.",1],[0,"Oh, too bad.","O, kaip gaila.","77fde5db8f45",2.11],[-1,"Thank you very much!","Labai ačiū!",1],[0,"You're welcome!","Prašom!","0c2891f38e11",1.1],[-1,"How do I get there?","Kaip ten nueiti?",1],[0,"Go down this street, and it's on the left.","Eikite šia gatve – nuovada bus kairėje.","b631e339a2a2",2.85],[0,"Okay, a small 